---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Mailing List - Eclipse Open Integration Engine" description="How to read and post to oie-dev@eclipse.org, the Open Integration Engine mailing list.">
  <article class="container-narrow page">
    <PageHero
      title="Mailing List"
      lead="oie-dev@eclipse.org is the project's mailing list, hosted by the Eclipse Foundation."
    />

    <section class="steps">
      <div class="card card--padded-sm">
        <h2>Post to the list</h2>
        <p>Only subscribers can post, and subscribing requires an Eclipse account.</p>
        <ol>
          <li>
            <a href="https://accounts.eclipse.org/user/register" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Create an Eclipse account</a>,
            or <a href="https://accounts.eclipse.org/user/login?destination=/mailing-list/oie-dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener">log in</a>
            if you already have one.
          </li>
          <li>
            Subscribe on the
            <a href="https://accounts.eclipse.org/mailing-list/oie-dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener">oie-dev list page</a>.
          </li>
          <li>
            Email <a href="mailto:oie-dev@eclipse.org"><strong class="address">oie-dev@eclipse.org</strong></a>.
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="card card--padded-sm">
        <h2>Before you post</h2>
        <p>
          Every message is published in the public archive. Leave out patient data, passwords,
          keys, and anything else that should not be public.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card card--padded-sm">
        <h2>Security issues</h2>
        <p>
          Do not report vulnerabilities on the list. Report them privately to the Eclipse
          Foundation Security Team at
          <a href="mailto:security@eclipse-foundation.org"><strong>security@eclipse-foundation.org</strong></a>,
          or follow their
          <a href="https://www.eclipse.org/security/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">vulnerability reporting process</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card card--padded-sm">
        <h2>Read the list</h2>
        <p>
          The <a href="https://www.eclipse.org/lists/oie-dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>archive</strong></a>
          is public and needs no account. New messages are also published as an
          <a href="https://www.eclipse.org/lists/oie-dev/maillist.rss" target="_blank" rel="noopener">RSS feed</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <p class="other">
      For Discord, GitHub, and other ways to reach the project, see the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page { padding-top: 3rem; padding-bottom: 4rem; }
  .steps { display: grid; gap: 1rem; }
  .steps h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 0 0 0.35rem; color: var(--color-headings); }
  .steps p { margin: 0; }
  .steps ol { margin: 0.75rem 0 0; padding-left: 1.4rem; }
  .steps li + li { margin-top: 0.4rem; }
  .address { white-space: nowrap; }
  .other { margin: 1.5rem 0 0; }
</style>
